{title: Khudaya Ve}
{artist: Salim Merchant Luck}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
Khu [C]daaya [F]ve Haaye,        [C]Ishq hai [F]kaisa yeh [C]ajeeb re
Khu [Em]daaya [F]ve Haaye,        [C]Ishq hai [F]kaisa yeh [C]ajeeb re
[C]Dil ke [Am]kareeb laaya,        [F]Dil ka [E]naseeb re
[C]Dil ke [Am]kareeb laaya,        [F]Dil ka [E]naseeb re
Khu [Em]daaya [F]ve Haaye,        [C]Ishq hai [F]kaisa yeh [C]ajeeb re
Khu [C]daaya [F]ve Haaye,        [C]Ishq hai [F]kaisa yeh [C]ajeeb re
[C]Ankhon se [Am]khwab chhute,        [Em]Apno se [Am]saath chhute
[F]Tapti hu [Fm]ie raaho me,        [G#]pairo ke [A#]chhale fute [Am]ae..
[G#]Hey ae ae ae [A#]hey ae ae x2,        [Am]Pyaase ta [G]dap rahe hai
[F]saahil ka [G]reeb [Am]re,        [Am]Pyaase ta [G]dap rahe hai
[Fm]saahil ka [G]reeb re,        Khu [Em]daaya [F]ve Haaye
[C]Ishq hai [F]kaisa yeh [C]ajeeb re,        Khu [C]daaya [F]ve Haaye
[C]Ishq hai [F]kaisa yeh [C]ajeeb re,        [C]Aansoo Namak [Am]Se Lage
[Em]Rishte Hai [Am]Kachhe Dhaage,        [F]Ret Pe [Fm]Apne Saaye
[G#]Khud Se Kyun [A#]Door Bhage,        [Am]Kheench Ke Hum [G]Ko Laya
[F]Kahan Pe [G]Rakeeb Re x2,        Khu [C]daaya [F]ve Haaye
[C]Ishq hai [F]kaisa yeh [C]ajeeb re
